<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Waver Services</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#000;
color:#fff;
}

nav{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
padding:20px 80px;
background:#111;
position:sticky;
top:0;
}

nav h1{
color:#FFD700;
font-size:35px;
}

nav ul{
display:flex;
gap:35px;
list-style:none;
}

nav ul li a{
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:18px;
transition:.3s;
}

nav ul li a:hover{
color:#FFD700;
}

.hero{
height:90vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
flex-direction:column;
background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.7),rgba(0,0,0,.8)),
url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622286342621-4bd786c2447c?w=1400");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:60px;
color:#FFD700;
}

.hero p{
margin-top:20px;
font-size:22px;
width:70%;
}

.hero button{
margin-top:35px;
padding:15px 45px;
font-size:20px;
border:none;
background:#FFD700;
cursor:pointer;
border-radius:40px;
font-weight:bold;
transition:.3s;
}

.hero button:hover{
transform:scale(1.1);
}

.services{
padding:80px;
}

.services h2{
text-align:center;
font-size:45px;
color:#FFD700;
margin-bottom:50px;
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:35px;
}

.card{
background:#111;
border-radius:15px;
overflow:hidden;
transition:.4s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-10px);
box-shadow:0 0 25px gold;
}

.card img{
width:100%;
height:240px;
object-fit:cover;
}

.card h3{
padding:20px;
font-size:28px;
color:#FFD700;
}

.card p{
padding:0 20px 20px;
color:#ccc;
}

.card button{
margin:20px;
padding:12px 30px;
background:#FFD700;
border:none;
font-weight:bold;
border-radius:30px;
cursor:pointer;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<nav>

<h1>Waver</h1>

<ul>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/service">Services</a></li>
<li><a href="/login">Login</a></li>
</ul>

</nav>

<section class="hero">

<h1>Premium Barber Experience</h1>

<p>
Book India's Best Barbers in Seconds.
Luxury Haircuts, Beard Styling,
Hair Spa & Grooming.
</p>

<a href="/login">
<button>Book Appointment</button>
</a>

</section>

<section class="services">

<h2>Our Services</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621605815971-fbc98d665033?w=800">
<h3>Hair Cut</h3>
<p>Professional haircut with modern styling.</p>
<button>Book Now</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517832606299-7ae9b720a186?w=800">
<h3>Beard Styling</h3>
<p>Premium beard trimming & styling.</p>
<button>Book Now</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521590832167-7bcbfaa6381f?w=800">
<h3>Hair Spa</h3>
<p>Healthy hair treatment with premium products.</p>
<button>Book Now</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431202-1e0f0137899a?w=800">
<h3>Facial</h3>
<p>Luxury facial and skin care service.</p>

<button>Book Now</button>
</div>

</div>

</section>